settled Matthias 2026-11-07: bar 23 ("Somebody bet on de"), A (Heart Songs 1909) has F#4:2 G#4:1 A4:1 G#4:2 F#4:1 F#4:1, B (Benteen 1850, moved +2) has F#4:2 G#4:1 A4:1 G#4:1 F#4:2 F#4:1; and the last note, A E4:6 closing against the pickup, B E4:8, a full last bar because Benteen's voice enters after a piano introduction; Zitro plays the old print's version (Heart Songs 1909), and a crop of A's scan confirmed A.
